sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as User (Physical Mobile Device)
    participant App as PayShield Mobile Client
    participant BankWeb as Bank Portal (Attacker / Web Session)
    participant Bank as Dummy Bank Backend (8001)
    participant PS as PayShield Gateway (8000)
    participant Push as Expo / FCM Push Gateway

    Note over BankWeb,Bank: Phase 1: Banking Transaction Initiated
    BankWeb->>Bank: Initiate Fund Transfer (Amount, Beneficiary)
    Bank->>Bank: Generate Banking OTP (status: OTP_PENDING)
    Note over BankWeb: Attacker enters intercepted OTP
    BankWeb->>Bank: POST /api/otp/verify/ (OTP Code)
    Bank->>Bank: Verify OTP -> Status: AWAITING_APPROVAL

    Note over Bank,PS: Phase 2: Out-of-Band Integration Push
    Bank->>PS: POST /api/integration/transaction-context/ (X-Dummy-Bank-Token)
    PS->>PS: Resolve verified LinkedBankAccount & active Device
    PS->>PS: Create ApprovalRequest (status: PENDING, timer: 60s)
    PS-->>Bank: 201 Created (approval_id, expires_at)

    Note over PS,App: Phase 3: High Priority Push Alert
    PS->>Push: Dispatch High-Priority Push Notification
    Push->>Customer: Alert banner: "High-value transfer needs your approval"
    Customer->>App: Tap Notification & Launch PayShield

    Note over Customer,PS: Phase 4: Hardware-Bound Decision
    App->>PS: GET /api/approvals/ (Authorization: Token, X-Device-ID)
    PS->>PS: Validate Token age (< 24h) & verify active Device UUID
    PS-->>App: 200 OK (Transaction details, live countdown timer)
    Customer->>App: Review Details -> Tap "Deny" / "Approve"
    App->>PS: POST /api/approvals/{id}/decide/ (decision: DENIED / APPROVED)
    PS->>PS: Atomic DB Row Lock (select_for_update)
    PS->>Bank: POST /api/transactions/decision/ (X-PayShield-Token, decision)
    Bank->>Bank: Update Transaction Status (CANCELLED / COMPLETED)
    Bank-->>PS: 200 OK
    PS-->>App: 200 OK (Decision confirmed)
    Note over Customer,App: Phase 5 (If Fraudulent): Instant Cyber Crime Report
    Customer->>App: Tap "Report Cyber Crime"
    App->>PS: POST /api/approvals/{id}/report-fraud/ (Category, Notes)
    PS->>PS: Generate Reference (NCR-2026-XXXXXX) & Log Audit Event
    PS-->>App: 201 Created (Complaint Ref, Helpline 1930, cybercrime.gov.in)
